        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD SD-PCF100003SBRT, 3 Inch Acrylic Shower Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 Inch Acrylic Shower Knob comes packaged with everything you need to install on a glass shower door including a screw cover. The acrylic has a 1 inch diameter and is available as either clear or frosted. The mount is made out of solid brass. Choose from a wide array of mount colors including polished brass, satin nickel, or oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF07-specifications.gif?v=1704354731\" width=\"471\" height=\"206\" border=\"0\" alt=\"FII-SD-PCF100003SBRT Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Pacific Acrylic Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Cover Outside Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Cover Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262251\"><b>DWD-SD-PCF100003SBRT/SCF100 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with one (1) pull thru-bolt mounted with matching screw cover.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3 inch Acrylic Shower Hook",
                "description": "The 3 Inch Acrylic Shower Knob comes packaged with everything you need to install on a glass shower door including a screw cover. The acrylic has a 1 inch diameter and is available as either clear or frosted. The mount is made out of solid brass. Choose from a wide array of mount colors including polished brass, satin nickel, or oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n",
